From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TripleU <182648541+TripleU613@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:32:19 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] J714s release 2 package set: speaker roles, re-pinned kernel
 and Aura

Two support roles, speakerguardd-v2 1.0.0alpha.1-41.1 (aarch64) and
aurora-speaker-upgrade 0.1-16 (any), speakerguardd v2 04169c44: the j714s profile
names 20 roles, as aurora-sep and libfprint-aurora were added, so every image
installs them and the image pin keeps them.

Re-pinned from betizzel/omarchy-m5 1b9d5ef: linux-aurora 7.3.0.aurora17.v272-2
(integration/aurora a34d26c2; a13a2559..., 44127181 bytes), m1n1-aurora
1.6.1.aurora24.v272-2 (Aura 22b71758; ec19c40e..., 2469202 bytes) and
omarchy-aurora-firmware 20261014.j714s8-1 (e31dcfd1..., 47835 bytes: one protected
speaker path, the v2 UCM condition, the speaker upgrade enabled at boot with
upstream's opt-in flag, VRR range on, the first-boot camera setfile). The
qualification pins follow 7.3.0-17.v272-2-ARCH. Set j714s-dev-runtime-ac7e940e5bf9.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
